      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So you want to use the trigger to be able to mute and unmute while the quick menu (not the radial menu) is open, am I understanding this correctly?\n \nI was going to recommend looking into my SteamVR settings as an example of how you can fit an overlay, playspace, and mute/unmute onto a control scheme. It's index only though and holds are used.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
